    {
      "item": "same version SourceDocument URL SekI and SekII",
      "decision": "KEEP",
      "reason": "Own HTTPS downloads and exact SHA comparison establish that corrected URL resolves the retained 52-page 25 March 2022 V2 bytes; the old URL resolves different 48-page original-2016 bytes. This approves correct identification only, not SekII paragraph science."
    },
    {
      "item": "original paragraph (3) candidate",
      "decision": "KEEP_BOUNDED_METADATA",
      "reason": "Heading plus paragraphs (1)/(2) physically17 printed15; actual paragraph (3) physically18 printed16. Three mappings are three partial targets of one normative source paragraph, not three independent normative paragraphs. Five sourceRef fields use the actual paragraph locator."
    },
    {
      "item": "separate paragraphs (3)-(10) alternative",
      "decision": "KEEP_BOUNDED_METADATA",
      "reason": "All eight actual numbered paragraphs on original physical18/printed16, with classes8/9/10 footer; only8 sourceRefs and same V2 URL change. Heading and (1)/(2) remain printed15. Integrator picks one alternative; never double counts subset plus full-eight."
    },
    {
      "item": "whole source coverage, original holds, and national superset",
      "decision": "HOLD_UNCHANGED",
      "reason": "Actual (3) supports particle-model interpretation of states, solution, diffusion and Brownian movement. It does not by itself prove quantitative solubility, saturation, mass fraction, every source operator, children or national scope. (4)-(10) remain distinct limited normative components; locator correction grants no mapping closure."
    }
  ],
